# CloudOps Platform — Architecture & Integration Contract

> **Version:** 1.1.0 · **Status:** FROZEN (change only via the process in §18)
> **Stack:** React (Vite + TypeScript) · FastAPI (Python) · PostgreSQL · Docker Compose
> **Purpose:** Single source of truth so Frontend, Backend and Cloud Adapters can be built **separately (by different AIs/people)** and still plug together on the first try.
> **Rule #1:** If this file and your code disagree, **this file wins**. Change the file first, then the code.

