## 0. How to use this file (read first)

1. Give **this whole file** to every AI/dev, plus the matching role prompt from §19.
2. **Frontend** builds only against the API contract (§7–§9) and the types (§6). Never guess a field.
3. **Backend** implements exactly those endpoints, shapes, enums and error codes.
4. Both sides work in parallel: Backend ships **mock cloud adapters + seed data** (§11); Frontend runs on **MSW mocks built from the JSON in this file** until the backend is ready. Switching to the real backend must need **only env changes**.
5. Anything not defined here → log it as a **CONTRACT GAP** (§18) and ask. Do not invent silently.

